<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Bella</book>
  <para style="h">2 Koorinteeneeb</para>
  <para style="toc1">Koorinteeneeb yꞌaamanana eebiib ujawaab umalya</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Koorinteeneeb</para>
  <para style="mt">Koorinteeneeb yꞌaamanana eebiib ujawaab umalya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Baawloos, Ukwaasanaayt niyaatii Umasiih Yasuuꞌiib ulinguumaawwa, Tiimootiib usaniisoonwa, Koorinteeneeb teefeet Ukwaasanaayt tukaniisi beeti, Akhaaꞌiyaay eefeen Ukwaasanaay oodehay kasseeh hiddaab beeti kataab ujawaab.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Ukwaasana Baabiisoonwa Wꞌankwana Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiiwwa ikatiib umꞌasigwa tinꞌimaawwa geebookna baꞌiiktiin.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Whamaad Ukwaasanaawwa Wꞌankwanaayoon Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiib Ubaabaaywa baꞌiikti. Ubaaba inꞌakwmanaayana, kastuuh tushamaam hooy eetniyeeb Ukwaasana, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />kasseeh hineeb igwirhaayeeb eeshtiimoon, aflaay baliib gwirhaayeeb eefeen han hinin iknaayaan Ukwaasanaay nimriyeet tushamaam bareeh neeshtiim nikati. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Umasiihiit tilhanay ishuukeeyoon kehii eetfiifneet toonaatiit, aflaay masi Umasiihi geebii Ukwaasanaayt tushamaam toowin nimꞌadhiidh. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Hinin lhamnayeek, tuun batuuh bariitook shamaamwa midhhanwa tikati. Hinin aree shamaamt nimeereek, baruuk han shamaamt timriya, tarmuumaab marriyi jillaay aree akrir tittiyeewaaya. Aflaay baruuk han sabir dꞌiit oon hineet tilhanay tꞌiiteet lhanay haay timtariimi akrir tittiyeewaaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Hinin usꞌaya bariiyook nibariyi aree akraabu, baruuk hineet tilhanay timꞌadhiidhi sabbii ikatiyeet toona nikteen. Aflaay masi baruuk hinin nimeereet tushamaamtiib han imꞌidhidh hoon tindiya.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Isanaayaan, Aasiyaay whaashiib niibriyeeb igwirha shꞌiteeneet toona hookna nhariw. Hinin akra rabi kehoon daasamaa iifi, nimtirimee dehaay ootaad dehaay kinbari akay umidhhanoon yigwhaa niifi. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Iginꞌaayeesoon yat dehoon haakamamtaneeb hiisna. Tuun tuuna aree igarooyeen dehaay binꞌadehamayeet toonaatu, laakiin Ukwaasanaay dehaay adehamnayeet toona sootni. Ukwaasana yꞌayaab ishidhhiin bariiyooh dehaay adehamnayeet toona sootni. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Baruuh bak isoodiir gwirhaayee ishidhhan hoon, masi aree ishidhhin hoon indi. Hinin han usꞌaya bariiyooh kehii daasaaba, shaawti baruuh diimaab ishidhhin hoon indi. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Baraak siileeltii hinin teeshtiimneet toonaatiit, aflaay gwida aree hinee jillaay Ukwaasana yhimid iyadna, hini jillaay tikatiit tuusileel aree agbilami tindi, Ukwaasana han baaraki hoon indi. <verse eid="2CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Oontꞌa tuun tuuna hinin habnaab dehoon tikati: hinin iknaayaan toon tuduniyaatiib nidꞌiyeet toona beet iginꞌaayaan ibadehana, Ukwaasanaay ikatiint tigadasaawwa oosdikwa ibadehana. Hinin tuduniyaatiit fagarandiiteet hayꞌaatii dꞌiyaab kinki, laakiin Ukwaasanaayt tinꞌimaateet hayꞌaatii nidꞌi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Baraak bitꞌagriiyayneena tari bitꞌafhamayneena dehookna kinkitib. Baraak beet batooh daayiib afhamteeneet toona minniimani, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />baraak tarab gal hoon afhamtaaneet toonaatiit, yꞌeetiit daayiib timmiima afhami hoon tiyadna. Aflaay baraak Wꞌankwana Yasuuꞌiit tooyintiib hinee habnami tiyadna, hinin han bareesookna habnami niyad.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Ani toon toona hooy akkadamaabu, aflaay malu doora rayiimteeni jillaay ani whankaay bareek rheesamtiib niyaaman. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Ani Magadooniyaab ookiik iibaabee rheesamtiyookna niyaaman, Magadooniyaay agaree han wꞌaayookna ahariw, aree malya Yahuudaab ookiik tꞌiibaabtiib shamaamt hookna imiireet toona ahariw. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Ani toon toona niyaamanihoob, eetehakee adꞌi han? Tari ani amankiirhoob tuduniyaatiit hayꞌaatiit dꞌiitiit aflaay gaat midda tooknaatiib, “Awooh, awooh” aree “Abadan, abadan.” andi han?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Laakiin Ukwaasana sidik sidkiibu, hineet tudiigwat bareek beeti teebiit, “Awooh, Abadan” miyaad kitti. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ukwaasanaay Oor, Yasuuꞌa Umasiih, aneebwa Siilaaswa Tiimootiiwwa bareeyookna bitik bhaliinaneeb, baruuh “Awooh, abadan.” miyaad kiiki, laakiin bariiyooh geeb diimaab “Awooh” miyaad tikati. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Ukwaasana naaka waadiya idꞌiyeeb hooy baagwibiina, baraah Umasiihiib “Awooh” miyaad ikatiin. Aree bariiyooh geebii aflaay “Aamiin” uumiyaad, Ukwaasanaay umatuunii dehaay hinee bhaliimiini. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Oontꞌa Ukwaasana hininwa bareekwa kasseen Umasiihiib sꞌakirti isingiid hoon. Baruuh ishaamit hoon, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />baruuh ikinaamti khatim kehoon thꞌaabu, aree dibuuy akay Ishuukeeh hineeb iginꞌaayeeb idꞌi, gayii eetniit toona arbuuniya.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Ukwaasana anii badehi ikatiyeet toona waliikani, baruuh aniib ooginꞌa ikteen. Ani bareekna ashidhhiini jillaay Koorinteen beeti agaar kaaki. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Beet tuuna hinin wꞌiimaaniyookna kehii ankwanaamtiib kiiki, laakiin afirhiteeni jillaay geebookna shagaamnay. Baraakna wꞌiimaanii akirti tingadiinayt, geebookna shagaamnay.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Aflaay bareekna beeti yꞌeetiit warit lhanay hookna baadꞌiyi jillaay masi bareeyookna irheesamtii irꞌayi gayyaran. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ani bareekna gadabisiyeek, aneeb afirhisiini aaw mhiyaabu? Ani bareekna eebhat gadabsan. <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Oon usabbii aree been ujawaab dehookna aktib. Ani bareekna beeti yꞌeetiit gadabistiyookna hariwaab kaaki, baraakna oodehay aneeb afirhiseen eekna tikatiina. Ani afirhaab akatiyeek, baraak han afirhaab tikatiineet toona winneet akteen. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ani winneet gwirhaayeewwa, hadal ginꞌiiwwa, gwidaat milooteewwa dehookna aktib. Bareekna gadabistiib sehariwaab kaaki, laakiin tuun tuuna ani bareekna kasseekna kak areeyaniyeeb tisookiin hookna. <verse eid="2CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Gaal han gadab ikwasiyeek, kasseekna gadabisaab ikatiyeet toonaatiit aneeb winneet gadabisaab kiiki. Ani toon winneet isꞌikir kaadi. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Baraakna igwidakaayaakna bariiyooh kehii tidꞌiineeb ijasa barooh mhaabu. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Oontꞌa laakiin baruuh winneet biigadabayi jillaay baraak barooh afooyaana aree sꞌakirna. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Aflaay bariiyooh dehaay ureerookna akkadteeneet toona hookna aharriiw. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ani dehookna haay aktibeeb usabab: ijarrabamti kak hasameetiit, naatiibka aneeb tisnaakiirneet toona rhitiib ahariw. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Baraak gaal afooteeneek, ani han barooh afooyani. Ani afooyanihoob aree, ani afooya andiyeena tehayeek, bareeyookna jillaay Umasiihi suurii afooyan, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />uubliis gwilakaayoon biikaayi jillaay ani toon adꞌi. Baruuh niyaamiiniyeet toona nikteen.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umasiihii ikatiint tinasra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Ani Umasiihiib Usakana Udaayiib ibhaliiti jillaay Taroowaas abayihoob, beentooy shagaamti jillaay Wꞌankwana anii dehaay dheefaab ingil, <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />ani beentooy usanu Tiituus miraab kaakuuyt, masi mꞌasig miraab kaaki. Aflaay ani bareeh isalaamiib adiit Magadooniyaab beeti giigan.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Laakiin whamaad Ukwaasanaayu, Umasiihiib ansirama abuuki nikatiyi jillaay baruuh diimaab hinin maalhiyoon ikati. Hinee aree bariitooh tukanaan tooshkwaan kassooh oomhiin ibrir idꞌi. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Hinin Ukwaasanaay dehaay Umasiihiit shikwaant shakwiint tꞌiiteeba. Tushakwiin baliib yꞌidhhannaayi bitikwa baliib ikwidhiyaannaayi bitikwa baraamtini. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Eengal hinin tooyati baraam dehaay nikati, eeraw aree umidhhaniit shakwiint dehaay nikati. Oon ushagaay nadiir aaw ikati? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Gwida eefeen Ukwaasanaayt tudiigwat rayi jillaay yꞌabikna, hinin aree bareeh tꞌiiteeb kinki. Laakiin bariiyooh suurii nhas ginꞌii Umasiihiib bhaliinay, hinin aree Ukwaasana diigwataayoonu.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Hinin masi igarooyeen nhamid han? Tari dehay galneet hinin waseeti jawab bareesookna tari bareekna eebiin nhariw han? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Baraak iknaayaakna hini jawaab tikatiina, iginꞌiyoon kataabu aree uudehay kassaah ikteenna aree agriiyeena. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Baraak Umasiihi ooknaay kataab jawaab hinee aree diigwatamaab tikatiineet toona rhisteena. Uun baruuh galamii kataab kiiki, laakiin Ukwaasana udhhaniinaay Ishuukee ikati, ilhaayi kehii kataab kiiki laakiin wꞌaadami ginꞌaayi kehii kataabi.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Uun wꞌakra ginꞌa aree hineebu, hinin Ukwaasana suurii Umasiihiib akra ginꞌiiba. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Hinin iknaayaan naat daanay niyadee dehaay hag kinbari. Laakiin hinin naan nidꞌeeb kassooh ushaga Ukwaasana iniiw hoon. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Baruuh hinin ugalad ugayiinaay shagaamana ikwaas hoon. Tuun tuuna aree kataab hag kiiki, laakiin Ishuukee tikati. Whag ukataab tooyat haay yꞌiini, laakiin Aashuuk midhhan iyawna.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Whag aweeyi lhaayi kehii hiruufee naggashamiya, aree baruuh ittiyeewaayihoob, Ukwaasanaay umatuun lawiya. Muusaay ifiiri wꞌeeraamti giigiyaneek han, Israaꞌiiliib uudehay barooh ooshbuub adgiraab kiikeen. Whag tooyat haay yꞌiiniib bak akriree ikatiyeek, aree bak matuunii eeyaneek, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Ishuuki shagaay ikatiib umatuun aree kak ookiik winkaab ikati? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Ushaga wꞌaadami gwabab isidꞌiib matuun ibariyeek, aflaay ushaga tooshbu haay yꞌiiniib kak ookiik matuun iniiwkaabu? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Suur iifiib umatuun, oontꞌa eefeeb winneet win umatuuni geeb nisnadiireek, been suur iifi matuun kiiki. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Shalik door iifiib umatuun matuun ikatiyeek, aflaay diimaab daayiiniib umatuun kak ookiik winkaab ikati!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Shaawti hinin oon usꞌaya nibariyi sabbii winneet gwꞌagwaab nikati. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Hinin Muusaab tꞌiiteeb kinki, baruuh ifiireeh halakii ikwibis, Yꞌisraaꞌiili bariiyeeh ifiiri wꞌeeraamti giig biirhayni jillaay ifiireeh ikwibis. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Laakiin bareeh iginꞌaayaahna assamaaba, baraah ugalad ishꞌiiya agriimamiiniyihoob, oon amsi ookiik iginꞌaayaahna been whalak ooknaay kwabasa. Been whalak uudehay Umasiihiib daayeenihoob oobhaat itnagiil. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Oon amsi ookiik han Muusaay whag agriimamiiniyihoob, bareeh iginꞌaayaahna halakii itkwabiisna. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Laakiin gaal Wꞌankwanaay dehaay itꞌagiirihoob, whalaki hijaab uginꞌii giigiini. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Oontꞌa Wꞌankwana Eeshuuk ikati, aree Wꞌankwanaay Aashuuk daayeeneeb oomhiin aree fadagooyt tikati. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Aflaay hinin kassaan nagal fiiree Wꞌankwanaay umatuun rhisnay. Winka matuun ameeshiwaayiit barooh tꞌiiteeb nikati, been umatuun Wꞌankwanaay yꞌiini, aree baruuh Eeshuuk ikati.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Ishuuki miraay idiwaneeb eefeeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Ukwaasana tirhamaateesooh oon ushaga yhii hoon, aflaay hinin afreeni kindi. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Hinin kasteeh teena tikwabaswa isalala yꞌisiisakwꞌiiwwa nirib. Gaal han kintilis, tari Ukwaasanaay ibhali kinbidil. Laakiin Ukwaasanaay suurii oosdik soonay, aree kassaah baliin usidki toon ikteenna. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Hinin bhaliinayeeb usakana udaayi kwabaas ikatiyeek, baliib ikwidhaab eebhat hooy kwabaas ikati. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Uubliis toon tuduniyaati kwaasana ikatiib, baliib yꞌaamanaab baakaayni iginꞌa hamasheesaabuuyt, aflaay baraah beeb Umasiihiib umatuuni wꞌinjiili nuur adgiriit karhiyaana, aree baruuh Ukwaasana tꞌiiteebi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Hinin iknaayaan kabhaliina, laakiin Yasuuꞌa Umasiih Wꞌankwanaayt, hinin iknaayaan aree Yasuuꞌi jillaay bareeyeekna kishiya nikati. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ukwaasana “Uthibnii uunuur buubi indi!” diyaab ikatiib, unuurooh iginꞌaayeen tehooyteeb buubisiya. Uunuur Ukwaasanaay umatuuniit kanaant Umasiihi suurii iniiw hoon. <verse eid="2CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Laakiin hinin oon oomraay adaarhaashi diwaneeb nibari, aan yꞌakrir usidki hinee kiikeena laakiin Ukwaasanaay ikatiineet toona rhiseen hoon. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Hinin diimaab gwirhaayeeb neefi, laakiin katꞌamaab kinki. Door gaal eetehaknay, laakiin door han yigwhaab kinki. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Amaag nitweeraay, laakiin atooꞌishaab kinki, nitoothꞌa laakiin kwidhaab kinki. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Hinin igarooyoon tehooyteeb diimaab Yasuuꞌiit tooyat nitfayiik, aflaay Yasuuꞌiib umidhhan han igarooyoon lawiiniib ikati. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Hinin idhhaniib nikatiib Yasuuꞌi jillaay diimaab tooyat beeti nittiyeewi, aflaay bariiyuuh umidhhan hineeb ubashari garooy lawiiniib ikati. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Aflaay malya tuuyat hineeb shagaami tindi, laakiin umidhhan bareeyookna shagaami indi.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Uuktaab “Ani aamanan akay hadiidan.” diyaabi. Oon bak tꞌiiti iimaani shuuk, hinin han aamannay aree shaawti hadiidnay. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ukwaasana, Wꞌankwana Yasuuꞌaab tuyatii yakisiyaab, hinin han Yasuuꞌi geeb yaksi hoon indiyeet toona nikteen, aree bareeyookna geeb bariiyooh suurii haay yꞌi hoon indi. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Tuun tuuna kastuuh bareekna rayiisi tindi, aflaay gwida dehay ikatimt tinꞌima hamaad ikwasiina aree whamaad Ukwaasanaay umatuun beeti iitfaf indi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Aflaay afreeni kindi. Tisaradtaan diiseet suuseeneek han, tehooytaan oombꞌi oombꞌii dehaay gayiimeen. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Oontꞌa ishalik doori gwirha ilhaseenaan, ansiriit hoon daayim matuun iyawna hoon, aree kasseeh igwirhaayi mhakwal iikti iyadna. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />Aflaay igwꞌadeen toona tulawtiniit kinshiishabib, laakiin toona tulawaat baakaay nishiishabiib. Tuuna tulawtiniit hallaay tikati, laakiin tuuna tulawaat baakaay daayimt tikati.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Oontꞌa tubuutiit kheema hooy nikweereet katꞌami tindiyeet toona nikteen. Hinin Ukwaasanaay ikati gaw nibari, tibreeteeb eefi daayim gawu, udehayi ayee aree dꞌaar kiiki. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Oontꞌa aree hinin gagarnay, tibreeti halakaayee neetkwiyeet toona winneet nhariw. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Beet toona neetkwiyihoob akay, rabooba nitmir kindi. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Hinin toon tukheemaatiib nikweereet midda, gagarnay aree rabeemnay. Hinin raboobnayeet toona kinhariw akay, laakiin tibreeti halakaayee neetkwiyeet toona nhariw. Aflaay bashar tibariinaaka umidhhanii itkwitꞌa indi. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Oontꞌa toon toonaati jillaay Ukwaasana akhligiya hoon, Eeshuuk aree tudaasanaaytiit yhii hoon, harꞌook eetniit toona arbuuniini. <verse eid="2CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Shaawti hinin winneet akra ginꞌiiba, hinin ugarooy tehooyteeb ugawiib daanayihoob, Wꞌankwanaay sigiyaab nikati. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Hinin wꞌiimaanii nikweer ooshbuubii kiiki. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Hinin winneet akra ginꞌiiba, andi, aree ugarooy niseegeet toona nhariw, aree ugawiib Wꞌankwanaay geeb daanayeet toonaati. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Aflaay hinin ugarooy tehooyteeb ugawiib daanayeek tari hooy niseegeek, barooh wꞌafirhisti hadafeen nikwasiyeet toonaati. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kassaan Umasiihiib ugaadi kwirsi suurii ibakii lawnayeet toonaati. Aree gaalka ugarooy tehooyteeb iifiyihoob idꞌiyeet teena tibaruuh astehaliiniyeet imaar indi, maagt tikatiyeek tari daayiinaayt gaalka toona tꞌastehaliiniyeet imaar indi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wꞌamꞌaduulaayt khidma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Wꞌankwanaay imirkwaay naan ikatiyeeb nikteeniyeek, oodehay sootiib jarrabnay. Ukwaasana daayiib ikteen hoon, baraakna han uginꞌiyookna aneeb tikteeniineet toona minniimani. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Hinin masi igarooyeen bareeyookna dehaay waseetiib kinhariw, laakiin baraakna hinee habnamteeneet toona soonay hookna. Aflaay baraak toona tulawtiniitii habnameen baliib dehaay tigweebneet toona adgirteena, aree iginꞌaayeeb teefeet toonaatii kiiki. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Hinin igirma neetniiweek, tuun batuuh Ukwaasanaay jillaay tikati. Hinin igirmaayaan takwakw ikatiineek aree, tuun batuuh bareeyookna jillaay tikati. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Umasiihiib uureer hinin salooliini hoon, aree gaal tak kasseeh oodehayi jillaay ayaab ikatiyeet toona nikteen, aree shaawti kassaan ayaaba. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Baruuh hini jillaay ayaabu, baliin idhhaniib igarooyeehna jillaay ikwaar kiidiina laakiin bariiyooh jillaay ikwaar iyadna, baruuh bareeyooh jillaay ayaabu aree masi yakamiya.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Aflaay oontꞌaanee fidnaab hinin gaal han tuduniyaatiit hayꞌaatii niishbib kindi. Door gaal Umasiih oontꞌaaneet nishbibeek han, shaawti bak kasakna. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Shaawti Umasiihiib ikatiibka gayi nafar iikti indi. Umidhhan ishꞌiiya giigiya, gayi midhhan badooya! <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Uun kassuuh Ukwaasanaay miyaaw ikati, barooh ooknaawwa hininwa mꞌasig ibitkeen iidꞌi jillaay Umasiih diigwatiya. Aree barooh ooknaawwa irawi bitikwa umꞌasgi shagaay dꞌuuy yhii hoon. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Ukwaasana Umasiihiib iifi, tuduniya barooh ooknaay dehaay yꞌadil. Shaawti oodehayi kehii maagnaayti dhigwuuy daayi kiidi. Baruuh oon wꞌaduuliit diigwat tꞌajiibi yhii hoon. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Shaawti hinin Umasiihi diigwatkina nikati, Ukwaasana uukna tuwaliiktooh hinee ikwasi. Hinin Umasiihi yafii waliiknay: Ukwaasanaay geeb amꞌaddaalna! <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Umasiih danib kiibari, laakiin hini jillaay Ukwaasana barooh han hineeb idanib yꞌadhidh. Aflaay bariiyooh daanayihoob, Ukwaasanaayt tooshbu nitꞌadhiidh.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Hinin Ukwaasanaay geeb ushagaayoon, Ukwaasanaayt tinꞌimaati miyaay mishiit bitkwaasiineet toona hookna nhariw. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ukwaasana indiyeet toona maasiwna:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">Ukwaasana “Aniib udaayi door eeyanihoob, amaasiw hookna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">aree umidhhaniit tuyintiib, asham hookna.” diyaabi.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Andi hookna, oontꞌa Ukwaasanaay udaayi door yꞌaabu, oontꞌa umidhhaniit tuuyin tikati.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baawloosiib igwirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Hinin ushagaayoon gaal han gwihaab hooy marriyeet toona kinhariw. Aflaay gaalnaay salaliib han goofiit nidꞌeet toona kinhariw. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Laakiin hinin nidꞌeet toonaatiibka Ukwaasanaay shagaamana nikatiyeet toona rhisnay, igwirhaayeet amtarrimooytwa, wꞌamaag haalwa, ilhamtiiwwa, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />ithibꞌeewwa, oosjinwa, tiribshaywa, wꞌakra shagaaywa, isehariiwwa tehargwiiwwa, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />nhisuuytiiwwa, tufhamaatiiwwa, oosbirwa tunhas niiyaawwa, Eeshuuk Imugaddasaayeewwa, nhas reeriiwwa, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />sidki bhaliyeewwa, Ukwaasanaay akrireewwa, tooshbooti gadhꞌi wꞌayi umaykwaaywa utalhaaywa, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />umatuuniiwwa whamooysamti naawiiwwa, wꞌamaag sootiiwwa udaayi sootiiwwa Ukwaasana shagaamnay, aree igwisri dehayiit nishtabbaab laakiin masi oosdik hadiidnay. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Hinin atookakinaaba, laakiin masi atookakinaab baakaay udehayiit nishtabbiib. Hinin niyaayi, laakiin masi dhhaniiba. Nitoothꞌa, laakiin masi ayaab kinki. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Gadabna, laakiin diimaab afirhaaba. Aniwa, laakiin masi gwida rayi rayiimnay. Naat kinbari, laakiin naatka kinaamnay.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Bareekna Ikoorinteenaayi, usidkii hadiidsamna hookna, aree iginꞌaayeen daayiib dehookna ningil. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Hinin ureeroon hookna abkaab kinki, laakiin baraakna ureerookna hoon tꞌabikna. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ani oontꞌa bareekna yꞌareetu anfariid hookna, baraakna han hinin dehookna nibariyeet tooshbu tꞌiiteena rhisaana hoon. Iginꞌaayeekna han daayiib nigilna.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yꞌaamanaab baakaayni geeb baahasalna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Oodehay yꞌaamanaab baakaayni geeb baahasalna. Uudehay aashboobwa yꞌamagwa naan taktaki geeb ibariina? Tari uunuurwa uuthbinwa kak hiddaab ikweerna? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Umasiihwa Uubliiswa kak taafagsameen? Wꞌaamanaabwa wꞌaamanaab baakaaywa naan teeshwawi? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ukwaasanaay udiini gawwa isanamaawwa kak taafagsameen? Hinin Ukwaasana udhhaniinaay diini gaw nikati akay, Ukwaasana uukna han diyaabu: “Ani bareeyooh geeb ikwaar andi aree bareeyooh bitik saki andi, aree bareeyoohna Kwaasana iikti andi, aree baraah anii dehay iikti iyadna.” diyaabi.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />Aflaay Wꞌankwana, “Bareesooh firꞌana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">aree tifalna,</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="2CO 6:17">indi Wꞌankwana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Nhast baakaayna baatatehaana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">malya ani agbili hookna andi.<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Ani baabookna iikti andi, baraakna han anii arwa aritwa iikti tiyadna.” indi.</para>
  <para style="q4" vid="2CO 6:18">Wꞌankwana Wꞌalya bak indi.<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Yꞌarawaanay, een iwaadiya nimeereek, ugaroowwa eeshuukwa yiwaashiiseent kasteeh teena hinin iknaayaan hooy neenhasiyeet toonaati. Ukwaasanaay mirkwaayii winneet mugaddasaab nikatiyeet toonaati.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buulusiit tifirha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Iginꞌaayeekna tehooyteeb gaw dehoon dꞌiina. Hinin gaal han amaag weeraab kinki, gaal han maraayaab kinki, gaal han tilsaab kinki. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ani een bareeh bareek gwabab haay sꞌabuukiib kaadi. Een bareeh ani suur diyaabu, baraak hineeb iginꞌaayeeb bak tꞌiiti mhiin tibariina. Hinin needhhaniyeek geebookna needhhani, niyaayeek geebookna niyaayi. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ani bareekna winneet aamanani, winneet aree hookna habnamani. Ani winneet akra ginꞌiibu, kasseeh igwirhaayeen geeb aniit tifirha agiyaab kiibariin.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Hinin Magadoonyaab eenanihoob, uun hineeb ugaru fiinaab kiiki. Laakiin nakamnaneet jhaatiika amaag nitweeraay; barraay finaab aree tehooytee mirkwaay hoon daaya. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Laakiin Ukwaasana iginꞌaayeet tehooy isꞌakiir, Tiituusiib wꞌaayii isꞌakir hoon, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />aree bariiyooh wꞌaayii oobhaat kiiki, laakiin barooh tehiiyyeet tisꞌakirooy han tisꞌakir hoon. Baruuk aniib eerhi harawaayook baruuh sooyi hoon, winneet igwirhaayeekwa, anii dehaay tiibriyeet tudaayiinaaywa sooyi hoon, aflaay aniit tifirha gwidakaat ikeen.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Ani ujawaabiisu gwirhaab kehookna adꞌiyeek han, andimaab kaaki. Andimaab iiktiyeek han, laakiin ujawaabu lhasiyaneetookna toona akteen, laakiin shalikt midda toobhaat lhasiya hookna. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Oontꞌa ani afirhaabu, ani bareekna gadabsaneet toonaati sabbii kiiki, laakiin igadabaakna tuubisiyaan hookna. Baraak Ukwaasana yharweet toonaatiit gadabtaana, aree hinin bareek adaatniina kwaasaab kinki. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Ukwaasanaay ikatiin igadab umidhhan istoobiint tuuba ikatiin, aree nadamt kiikwaasna. Laakiin tuduniyaatii ikatiin igadab yat haay yꞌeen. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Aan Ukwaasanaay ikatiin igadab hookna idꞌiineet toona shibibna: baraah kak fagaraab ikwaasna hookna, igarooyeekna kak tisinhasna! Hasiyaaytwa, midgweegwtwa, hayꞌiibwa, shibootwa, aree wꞌadil ikatiyi jillaay timarniit tishbibna. Kastooh toon tehalaagaaytiib baraak naatiibka nhas tikatiineet toona rhistaana. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ani marookna jawaab aktibeek han, beet toomaag idꞌiib tari toomaag itweeraay bariiyooh sabbii kiiki. Laakiin baraak Ukwaasanaay suurii hinee dehaay kak daayiib tikatiineet toona iknaayaakna rhiteeneet toona adgirteena. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Hinin kastooh tunaatiib akra ginꞌiiba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Hineeb wꞌakra ginꞌi geeb, Tiituus kak afirhaab iiktiyeeb rhinanihoob winneet nimdhadh. Bariiyaah aashuuk bareek kasseesookna gayiimiyaani sabbii hinin nimdhadh. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Ani bareesookna habnamaab iiktiyeet toona barooh sooyan, baraak han aneeb siisakwꞌaab kitteena. Laakiin bareekna soonaneet tuuna kastuuh sidikuuyt, bareesookna iiktiin yhabna Tiituus soonaneeb han sidik iiktiin. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Baruuh baraakna kassaakna tisnaakirneet toonaawwa, mirkwaayiiwwa katateewwa tꞌashishneet toonaawwa shꞌiiniyihoob, baruuh bareekna areeyiiniyeeb uureer kassuuh winkaab ikati. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ani bareekna aamananiyeet toonaatiib winneet afirhaabi.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Oomyaaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Isanaayaan, oontꞌa aree Ukwaasana Magadoonyaayt tikaniisa yhiiyyeet tinꞌima tikteeniineet toona nisehariiw hookna. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Baraah gwirhaayeeb daayaaneek han aree winneet aniw iiktiineek han, umiyaawiib afirhaa iyiwna aree winneet hadareeba. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Baraah toona tꞌadgiriineet gwidaana yhiineetoon toona ani badehiib akati. Baraah masi utaadiyoohna mhakwal han yhiin hoon. Baraah iknaayeet niyaatii, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Ukwaasanaay oodehayi shagaamtiib alya adhidh hooy imeerneet toona hoon yhariwna. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Baraah hinin sꞌayaamnaneet toonaatiit dꞌiyaab kiikeena, laakiin baraah hankaab igarooyeehna Wꞌankwana yhiina, aree malya Ukwaasanaayt niyaatii igarooyeehna hinin yhiina. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Aflaay hinin Tiituus willa soona, baruuh suur badooyaab iiktiyeeb tinꞌimaati shaga bareeyookna geeb faaysiiniyeet toonaati. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Laakiin baraakna naatiibka daayiib tidꞌiina: wꞌiimaaniibwa, ibhaliyeebwa, tukanaantiibwa, timmiimaat daayiinaaytiibwa, hinee dehaay tibariineeb ureeriibwa, kasseeh daayiib tidꞌiina. Aflaay umiyaawiit tinꞌimaateeb han daayiib tidꞌaneet toona nhariw.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ani bareekna kawaseeyan, laakiin ureeriyookna oosdik jarrabeetiit irawi sidki geeb asnaddiireet toona aharriiw. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Baraak Wꞌankwanaayoon Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiit tinꞌima tikteenna. Baruuh gabaab iiktiyeek han, bareeyookna jillaay aniw iki. Aflaay bariiyooh unaawii baraakna gabeen tikatiin.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Aree toon tunaatiib bareekna naan dehookna hanyiiseeb ani tooy waseet aniiw hookna: whawil whasamiyaab baraak umiyaawiib suurii oobhaat kitehaayna laakiin umiyaawiit niya han tiibriina. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Oontꞌa ishaga faaysaana, aflaay ishagaay dꞌuuyiit niyaatuukna ishaga faaysiteenihoob ituukkin tindi, oontꞌa tibariineet toonaatii dꞌiina. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Tuniya tehayeek, gaal toona tꞌibariyeenaatii uumyaaw hooy agbilamiini, toona tubiibariyeetii kitti.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Bareek abiiyaakna gwirhaayeeb haayee oodehay eeraw aweena miyaad kinsehariw, laakiin ibakii nadiir ikatiin. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Oontꞌa gwidaana tibariinihoob, oodehay tishanhatiya ibariin shamna. Aflaay baraah han gwidaana ibariinihoob, eeshtiimna hookna. Malya kassaakna nadiir tikatiina. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Uuktaab “Gwidaana idbil uutak gwidaana miraab kiiki, aree shalikna idbil uutak han shalikna miraab kiiki.” diyaabi.<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tiituuswa yꞌarawaahwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ani Ukwaasana ahammiid, baruuh ani dehookna abariyeet tudaayiinaay tꞌiiteena Tiituusiib uginꞌiib idꞌi. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Tiituus hineet tuwaliik toobhaat agbilaab kiiki, laakiin baruuh akraab hammasamaa yꞌiini hookna, aree baruuh uukna bak yharriiw. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Hinin aree tikaniisa kastaah usakana udaayiinaay shagaay yhamidneeb usanoon bariiyooh geeb dehookna nifdig. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Masi aree, oon ushaga Wꞌankwanaay matuuni jillaay shagaamtii dehaaywa, hinin udehayiit shamaamt nhariweet toona rhisnayi jillaaywa, barooh tikaniisa waasiyaaniit isoorimna hoon. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Hinin oon whadareemti miyaaw kak nꞌabkeeb gaalnaay yaay han kinhariw. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Wꞌankwanaay suurii oobhaat kiiki laakiin oodehayi suurii han sidkiib nikatiyeet toona nhariw.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Masi aree, gwida salalaayee gwida doora wꞌashꞌartiyooh rhisiyanoon usanoon bareeyooh geeb diigwatnay. Oontꞌa aree masi gwidakaana hammasamaabu, aree bareekna winneet aamaniini. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Tiituus anii shariikiibu, aree ibitkeekna shagaamiini. Aree isanaayaan aaraw tikaniisaati wakiilaaba, aree Umasiihi habna ikatiin. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Shaawti een eenda ureerookna rhisaana, aree hinin bareesookna habnamnayeeb yhabnaayi sabab rhisaana. Aflaay tikaniisa beet toona rheeneet toona adgireen.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ukwaasanaay udehayiit shamaamti jillaay dehookna akantiibee dehaay shanhatiyaat kiihaayna. <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />Baraakna tushamaam tehariwneet toona akteen. Magadoonyaay oodehay aree toon haay habnamaab akatiyeet toona sooyan, gideemha Akhaaꞌiyaay ani baraak bareeyooh oomyaaw dehaay amar tiiktiineet toona sooyan. Wꞌashꞌartiyuukna aree bareeh winneet yayakisiya. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Aflaay bareesookna habnamaab nikatiyeeb yhabna mishiit bhaliib biikaayni sabbii ani isanaayeen diigwatani. Laakiin oon ani adiyeet tunaatiit, baraak eetmiir tikatiina. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Magadoonyaay gaal han anii geeb yꞌeetiit bareek amar baakaay marriyuukna, hinin bareek naat kindi, laakiin bareekna winneet aamannayi sabbii nisakwꞌa. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Aflaay isanaayeen whankaay marookna fidigtiit, oomyaaw baraak waadiyaayaab tikatiineeb tisoomiirneet toona akwin. Malya uumyaaw daayiit hadarti miyaawiit tisoomiirna, akraat waajibti miyaawiit kiiki.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Toon toona shꞌaana: shalik teera ingiidka shalik harru inwiik, gwida teera ingiidka gwida harru inwiik. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Aanda kassaah gaalka uginꞌiyooh niyaamaab ikatiyeeb oomyaaw iniiweet toonaatu, ribee ginuuf aduuyii kiiki. Ukwaasana umiyaawana afirhaa iniiw areeyiini. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Ukwaasana aree kasteeh tinꞌima dehookna guudsiiniyee dehaay adgiriini. Aflaay kasteeh tinaateeb kassoohoob toona tutehariwneet kastooh timeerna, aree kassooh tudaayiinaayti shagaay gwidaana imaar tiyadna. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Uuktaab indi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Baruuh umiyaawooh oodehay wꞌaniwnaay dehaay ibrir idꞌi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">tushbootuuh diimaab daatni.” indi.<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Been idirꞌaatkina iteera iniiwwa, timꞌariiti hadhi iniiwwa, baruuh iteeraayookna guudsiini, aree tushbooti waakookna isoowiin. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Baraak kassooh oodoor hadareeb tikatiini jillaay, baruuh daayiib gabsi hookna indi. Aree hinee geebii bareetaakna tehadar Ukwaasanaay hamaad iikti iyadna.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Oon baraakna tidꞌaneeb ushaga Ukwaasanaay udehayiit shanhatiya teebhat kiisham, laakiin Ukwaasanaay whamaad gwida salalaayee iifif indi.<verse eid="2CO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Baraakna iknaayaakna rhistaaneeb ishagaay sabbii, uudehay Ukwaasana yhimid iyadna. Baraakna Ukwaasana tisnaakirniit Umasiihiib usakana udaayiib tifidhadhni sabbiiwwa, aree kastooh toona baliib irawi geeb tꞌadhidhneet tunaati sabbiiwwa, uudehay Ukwaasana yhimid iyadna. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Ukwaasana bareekna hiiyyaab ikatiyeet tinꞌima tigwidaanaati sabbii, baraah bareeyookna dehaay siileeleena aree bareekna rhitiib yhariwna. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Kalmaatee baaꞌawsifamii oomyaawii dehaay Ukwaasana nhamid.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Baawloos ushagaayooh daafꞌiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Ani Baawloos bareekna waliikani hookna: Umasiihiit shibootiiwwa eeraat niyaatiiwwa; ani geebookna daayanihoob dhiwꞌoorwa nꞌakwwa akati, laakiin fidnaab giiganiyihoob jaaꞌir akati. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Ani yꞌaniyihoob ajꞌirti shagaay bitdꞌiineetu toona hookna aharriiw. Hinin tuduniyaatiit hayꞌaatiit nikweer iyad baliib amꞌakiireet toona akteen. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Hinin tuduniyaatiib nikweereek han, tuduniya saktiniyeet toonaatiit hinin finaab kinkwaas. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Hinin haay finaanayeeb igadhꞌi tuduniyaati gadhꞌi kiikeen. Laakiin Ukwaasanaay akra gadhꞌee hinin akra difꞌa dhibisnay. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Hinin, amgwasuura dhibisnay, Ukwaasanaayt tukanaanti kehii yakeen eegwsir dhibisnay. Kassooh oofkir abuukiib kwaastiit Umasiihi isnaakiir nikwasi. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Baraakna barooh winneet tisnaakiirnihoob, malya tisnaakirooy inriibka jasaatii dehaay amar nikati.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Baraak tinaateet sarat teebhat tishabibna. Umasiihiib ikatiin iyad baliin hinin han een bareeh tꞌiiteena Umasiihiib nikatiyeet toona ibakii ikteenna. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Bareekna neeshtiimi jillaay aree lhastiyookna jillaay kiiki, Wꞌankwana yhiiyyeetoon tehadꞌaayeetiib winneet shalikna shaawtiit habnamaniyeek han, beet toonaatii ani iisikwꞌa kaadi. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Ani ijawabeesu bareekna soomhooyt jarrabtiib kaasehariw. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Gwadi “Barooh ijawabaah digaaba aree akraaba, laakiin baruuh uukna geeboon daayiiniyihoob, nꞌakwu aree ibhaliyaah han takweet kiibariin!” iyadna. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Hinin giignayihoob ijawabeeb niyadeet toona, daanayihoob han beet batooh tookna saknayeet toona aan uudehay afhameeneet toonaati.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Hinin igarooyeen baliib igarooyeehna asti ishabibnaayi geeb nidꞌeet toona tari nisnadiireet toona ajꞌireetiit kasakna. Baraah igarooyeehna eekna abiiyaahna abbareenihoob aree igarooyeehna iknaayi geeb isnadiirnihoob, baraah fagaraab kiikeen. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Hinin laakiin ifaalaan silt ibariina, aree ifaalaan Ukwaasana dehoon waasaab ikatiyeeb oomhiin kiitilalna. Been uumhiin bareekna han kantiim. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Hinin ifaaleeb winneet kinsigi, bareekna beeti yꞌaab binkaayeek tiiktiit toonaatiit, Umasiihiib usakana udaayiib niskatim hookna. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Weer dehay idꞌiineeb ishagaay faalamiit toosiltoon hasamaab kinki. Laakiin diimaab Ukwaasana dꞌiyaab ikatiyeet toosiltiib, bareekna wꞌiimaanuukna wintiit hinin masi gwidaka shaga geebookna nidꞌeet toona minniimnay. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Aflaay usakana udaayiib gidehookna eefeen yhasheeb bhaliinayeet toona adgirnay. Weer dehayi haashiib suur akay daamaab ishagaay faalamtiib kinhariw. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Laakiin uuktaab, “Wꞌinfiish, Wꞌankwana idꞌiyeet toonaatii baꞌiifish.” indi. <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Whayis ugarooyooh hammiid ootak kiiki, laakiin ootak Wꞌankwana daayiibu indiyeeb ikati.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Baawlooswa igwisri linguumaawwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Ani shalik door afrii sakaniyihoob han, baraakna timtariimneetu toona hookna aharriiw. Laakiin baraakna toon toona suur akay sakteena. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Ukwaasanaayt tugiiraatiit, ani bareeyookna dehaay giiraatani. Ani bareekna gaal takii dehaay waadiyaayan hookna aree baruuh Umasiih ikati. Aflaay nhast aagirtiit barooh nuuni hookna andi. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Laakiin ukwakwarii titootaalt Hawwaab tꞌiiteena bareekna han iginꞌaayaakna tinhisuuytiiwwa Umasiihiib wꞌatꞌiimtiiwwa fidnaab kwidheeneet toona arankwi. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Tak gaal yꞌeetiit hookna Yasuuꞌaab hinin bhaliinayeeb nuun weernaay bhaliisamiiniyuuk, tari eeshuuk itiyheeneeb nuun wari shuuk tiyayneek, tari wꞌinjiil wꞌagbiltaaneeb nuun weer ikatiyeek, beet toona kastooh hooy agbilteena. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Laakiin ani ilinguuma itageegaayeeka dhibakaab akatiyeet toona kahiisan. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Ani whadiidtiib hadiidanaab kaaki, laakiin tukanaan abari. Hinin toon toona gwida salalaayee daayiib rhisna hookna.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ani Ukwaasanaay wꞌinjiil dehookna bhaliiyihoob naat hookna hariwaab kaaki. Ani bareekna asoowiini jillaay ugarooyu dehookna ashꞌadhiim, beet tuuna aniit maagnaay tikati han? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Ani bareekna shagaamaniyi jillaay tikaniisa tirawtee mhallagaab ayhaayt asaalib. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Aree ani geebookna iifiyihoob naat ashinheek, gaalnaay kehii han rabeeb akaab kaaki. Isanaayaan Magadoonyaay eeyaan toona ani ashinheet kastooh itkwikwna. Ani bareeyookna kehii rabeeb baaꞌakaayee dehaay ugarooyu kaleewan, aree toon toona isuuririm andi. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Umasiihiib uusdik aniib eefi, kassooh Akhaaꞌiyaay whaashiib gaal han een eefaal hoosu isingid biidiyeet toona waadiyaayani. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Naanhooy? Ani kaꞌareeyan hookna akay tikati? Ani bareekna areeyaniyeet toona Ukwaasana ikteen! <verse eid="2CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Aree baliin ilinguuma aaraw eefaal haay imeerni sabab biidꞌiini jillaaywa oon hinin nidꞌeeb ishaga tꞌiiti shaga shagaamnay biidiini jillaaywa, toon toona oontꞌa sakaniyeet isuuririm andi.<verse eid="2CO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Aan aanda kassaah gwisri linguumamaaba, toolana shagaamanaaba, Umasiihi linguuma tꞌiiteena massalameen. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Uubliis han ugarooyooh unuuri malaktaayi tꞌiiteena massalamiiniyeet toona baaꞌajjabsaana. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Tuun batuuh ajjabsitiniina kiiti, malya, ishagaamanaayaah eeshbooneet massalameeneek, tuun batuuh bissaniit kitti. Wꞌaakharuuhna ishagaayuuhna astehaliiniyeet toona tꞌiiteeb iikti indi.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baawloos tilhanayteeh haay faalamiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ani masi andi hookna: gaal han wꞌafriinaayt biishabiibheeb. Laakiin bak tidꞌaneek, wꞌafriinaayt agbilaanheeb, aflaay shalik door faalamiiniib akati. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Oon wꞌakra ginꞌi ikatiib ifaalamti ani Wꞌankwanaayt tehayꞌaatii kahadiidan, laakiin wꞌafrii takiit hadiidani. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Gwida tuduniyaatiit hayꞌaatiit faalameen eefeena, ani han faalami andi. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Baraak fagaraab tikatiini sabbii oodehay yꞌafraya timtariimna. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Baraakna baliib bareekna kishiyaab ikwasiin timtariimna, tari bareekna suugeen tari bareekna sharakiib dhibseen, tari bareekna abaabeen, tari ifiireekna eethꞌa, kasseeh timtaraamna. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Hinin toon batooh winneet hooy nꞌakw nikatiyeet toona ani sikwꞌee hadiidani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Weer gaal faalamiiniyeek, ani han bak faalamani, laakiin beet toonaati dꞌuuy afreeba. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Baraah Ibriiba? Ani han Ibriibu. Baraah Israaꞌiiliiba? Ani han Israaꞌiiliibu. Baraah Ibraahiimi ara? Ani han Ibraahiimi ooru. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Baraah Umasiihi kishiyaaba? (Ani bak tꞌiiteenaatiib whadiidti ugirmaayu daayiib kiiki). Ani aree gwidakaana akati. Ani gwidakaana akraab shagaaman, diimaab gwida doora oosjin daaman, gwida doora amaag atoothꞌa, aree doorka doorka tooyat adwil. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Ay doora Iyahuuda mhay tamuunwa ashshadhig kwirbaj ithꞌanaheeb. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Mhay doora kwilꞌibtii atoothꞌa, door gaal geedaman, mhay doora tumarkab haay katꞌamtaheeb, aree ubhariib hawaadwa bꞌeebwa ahagit. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Ani gwidaat iibabt iibaaban. Kwaan bidhꞌisiyaheeb, gwihara bidhꞌisiyaanheeb, whaashu ooknaay da bidhꞌisiyaanheeb, Ijintiili bidhꞌisiyaanheeb, tumadiinaatiib bidhꞌan, whaashiib bidhꞌan, ubhariib bidhꞌan, aree gwisri sanaayee bidhꞌan. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Ani shagaaman aree gallabaman, whawaad asehar, tehargwiiwwa tiyaweewwa akan, aree mꞌariit anu sakan. Ani mikwꞌaraaman aree rabooban. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Kastooh toona tooraawti geeb, ani kasteeh tikaniisaati haaliib whasakaay sabbii bꞌeebka atootiir. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Gaal nꞌakw ikatiyihoob, ani han nꞌakw akati. Gaal danuub sakseenihoob, ani hasiyaaytii baloolani.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Ani ibakii faalamaniyeek, ani nꞌakw akatiyeet toona rhiseent tinaatee faalami andi. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Ukwaasana, Wꞌankwana Yasuuꞌiib Ubaaba ikatiib whamaad diimaab bariiyooh baꞌiikti. Ani gwisir baahadiidayeet toona baruuh ikteen. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Dimashigeeb whadꞌa Areetaasi whii iifiib whaakim anii abuuki jillaay tumadiinaati dheefaay gwꞌaadiigaab daasiya. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Laakiin ani biilii tehooyteeb daasaman aree teheetaati shibbaakii dhooman, malya ani bariiyooh wꞌayii adhhan.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Baawloosiib eerheewwa tudiintoohwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Ani ibakii atsayiikeet toonaatu. Naat hooy baarayiimayeek han, Wꞌankwanaay ikatiin eerheewwa ilawsitiibwa hadiidi andi. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Tamna fadhig hawlaayi suurii toobri tumhaya ookiik tafamiya tak ani akteen. Beet tuuna ugarooy tiiktiyeeb tari ugarooy barraab tiiktiyeeb kaakan. Ukwaasana ikteen. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Aree oon ootak akteen, baruuh ugarooy tari ugarooy barraab ikatiyeeb ani kaakan, laakiin Ukwaasana ikteen <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />baruuh tujanna beeti tafamiya. Baruuh kalmaatee baaꞌawsifamayna imaasiw, wꞌaadami beet toonaati sooti wꞌidin kiibari. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ani been ootak tꞌiiteena faalami andi, laakiin ani tunꞌakwuuytiib faalami andi nuun ugarooyu ooknaay faalami kaadi. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Ani faal aharriiweek han, oosdik sooyani akay, afrii tak iikti kaadi. Laakiin beet toona kasakan. Aflaay ani andiyeet tari sakaniyeet toonaati mhakwal gaal han inkwiineet toona kaahariw.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Laakiin ani rhaab akatiyeet teena tꞌajjabseennaati sabbii kibir baadꞌi jillaay, aniib ubashariib diint attiyeewiyaatu, oobliisi diigwatkina, aneeb addabiiniyee dehaay diigwatamiya. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ani mhay doora batooh fidnaab hoosu giigsiiniyee dehaay Wꞌankwana anꞌal. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Laakiin baruuh anii dehaay, “Aniit tinꞌima dehook mhaata, teenꞌakwiinihoob aniib yꞌakrir timmiimaat ikatiin.” idi. Shaawti ani tunꞌakwuuytiib winneet afihraa haay faalami andi, aflaay Umasiihiib yꞌakrir anii kehii daayeen ikatiin. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Oon usabbii aree Umasiihi jillaay ani tunꞌakwuuytiib madhaadh akati, uneewiib madhaadh akati, igwirhaayeeb madhaadh akati, wꞌamaag waraamtiib madhaadh akati, tꞌakraanaaytiib madhaadh akati. Ani nꞌakw akatiyihoob akay, malya ankiir.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baawloos Ikoorinteeni imshabaab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ani ugarooyu afreesan, laakiin toon toona baraakna hooy dhibsitaanheeb. Ani bareesookna daayiinayt ittiyuudiyeet toonaati. Ani takweet baabariiyeek han, baliib ilinguuma itageegaayeeka dhibakaab kaaki. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Taana ilinguumaayeet alaama rhiseent tꞌajaayibwa timꞌuujisaawwa winneet tarmuumaay geebookna daamiyaan. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ani bareeyookna kehii rabeeb akaab kaaki nuun, baraakna tikaniisa tirawtee dehaay kak dhibakaab tikatiina? Toon toomaag afooyaanheeb!<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Oontꞌa ani mhaya door bareeyookna rheesamtii dehaay eetmiir, aree rabeeb kehookna iikti kaadi. Ani aharriiweet tuuna imhallagaayeekna kiikeena laakiin ani bareekna aharriiw. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Aflaay ani abariyeet toona kastooh dehookna alankiikeet toona winneet hooy atmadhiidh, ugarooyu han bak awari. Ani gwidaka reer areeyaniyuukna, baraak dhibaka reer areeyiheeb tiyadna han? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ani bareeyookna kehii rabeeb akaab baakaayeet toona titfadhiidhna. Laakiin gali aneeb tallaasu iyadnaheeb aree talasaay abik hookna. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Bareekna beeti diigwataneeb eendee gaalnaay han suugan hookna? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ani, Tiituus marookna sakiyeet toona sooyan, aree usanoon bariiyooh geeb afdig. Tiituus suugaayookna kiiki, baruuh suugiya hookna han? Hinin gal shuukee shagaamaab kinki han? Aree gaal salal abkaab kinki han?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Hinin bareeyookna suurii igarooyeen habuuyiib bhaliinayeeb hiistiina han? Abadan! Baliib Umasiihi shagaamanaayeet, hinin Ukwaasanaay suurii bhaliini. Isanaayaan, hinin nidꞌeet tuuna kastuuh bareekna neeshtiimi jillaay shagaamnay. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Ani beentooy akantiimihoob, ani aharriiweet toonaatiit batehagiitneet toona arankwi. Aree baraakna han aniib tehariwneet toona hoosu batmariineet toona arankwi. Beentooy aree hasiyaaytwa, giiraatwa, akra gadabwa, amgaruumaawwa, haamtiiwwa, yaandiintwa, atoorbiyaaytwa, ribshaaytwa, tikatiyeet toona arankwi. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ani masi yꞌaniyihoob Ukwaasanaayu bareeyookna suurii dhibsiiniyeetu toona arankwi. Ani gwidaanee gadabi andi baliib suur danuub ikwaasniit tinajaasaatee tuubaab baakaywa, jikuuni danuubeebwa tumaagnaay tehooy dhibiyaaneetwa, hooy gadabi andi.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Wꞌakra sooti wꞌaakhareeb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Oontꞌa ani bareeyookna irheesamtiib uun mhaya door iikti indi. Uuktaab “Tikatiit halaagaayka ibakii maloob tari mhay badehi ibadehaneet toonaati.” diyaabi. <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Umalya door ani geebookna iifiyihoob, suur akay daayiib sooyan hookna. Ani oontꞌa geebookna baahaay toon masi arammiid: ani atꞌagiirihoob, baliib suur toomaag idꞌiin tari eeraw kasseeh, ijasaatii gaal han iiyꞌish kaadi. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Umasiih anii geebii hadiidiiniyeet toona alaamaat tehariwna. Bareeyookna tehooyteeb shaagaamiiniyihoob, baruuh nꞌakw kiiki, laakiin baruuh ibitkeekna akraabi. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Baruuh sallabamiyanihoob nꞌakw iiktiyeek han, laakiin oontꞌa baruuh Ukwaasanaay akriree kwarri. Hinin han bariiyooh nꞌakwa, laakiin bareekna shagaamnayi jillaay Ukwaasanaay akriree bariiyooh geeb nikwaar niyad.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Wꞌiimaaniib teheeneeb bitehaayneeb igarooyookna shibibna, igarooyookna akhtibaaraana. Umasiih Yasuuꞌa hookna eefiyeet toona karhitaana han? Bak biikaayeek baraak wꞌikhtibaariib dhibtaana. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Aree baraak hinin wꞌikhtibaariib dhibaab binkaayeet toona iikan tiyadneet toona aamanani. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Oontꞌa baraakna amaagna bitdꞌiini jillaay hinin Ukwaasanaay dehaay siileelnay. Hinin wꞌikhtibaar hasamaab nikatiyeet toona oodehayi rhisti kiiki, laakiin hinin dhibaana tꞌiiteeb nikatiyeek han, baraakna usidkii saki tiyadna. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Hinin usidki kehii naat han saknayeet toona kaꞌadgirna, laakiin usidki jillaay oobhaat saknay. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Hinin nꞌakw nikatiyeebka nitmadhiidh, aree baraakna akraab tikatiina. Aree tusiileeltuun bareeyookna timmiimti jillaay tikati. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Toon toonaati sabbii teen teena ani baahaayihoob akantiib, aree ani yꞌaniyihoob Wꞌankwana hiiyyaayu ikatiyeet tehadꞌaayeetii anfꞌamiit bareeyookna kehii ikir kaadi. Ani tehadꞌaayi bareekna eeshtiimi jillaay attiyeewaay, bareekna kwidhsaniyi jillaay attiyeewiyaab kaaki.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tusalaam tꞌaakhareet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Isanaayaan, aakhar aree usalaamiib andi hookna. Timmiimaab tikatiineet toona hariwna, aniit tuwaliik sinaakirna, gaal girmaay tꞌiiteeb akeena, aree umꞌasgiib kwiriina. Aree ooreeri Kwaasanaawwa umꞌasigwa geebookna baꞌiiktiin.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Gaal ooraaw mugaddast salaam salaamaana. <verse eid="2CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Ukwaasanaay uudehay kassaah tishiboonay salaameen hookna.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Wꞌankwana Yasuuꞌaab Umasiihiit tinꞌimaawwa, Ukwaasanaay uureerwa, Eeshuuk Imugaddasaayeet ramaamtwa, kasseeyookna geeb baꞌiiktiin.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>